{'symbol': 'BBWI', 'date': '2023-01-03 08:00:00', 'title': 'BATH & BODY WORKS APPOINTS HEATHER HOLLANDER\xa0VICE PRESIDENT, INVESTOR RELATIONS', 'text': "COLUMBUS, OHIO, JAN. 03, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BATH & BODY WORKS, INC. (NYSE: BBWI) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF HEATHER HOLLANDER AS VICE PRESIDENT, INVESTOR RELATIONS, EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY. MS. HOLLANDER WILL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR LEADING THE COMPANY'S INVESTOR RELATIONS PROGRAM, INCLUDING ENGAGEMENT WITH SHAREHOLDERS, INVESTORS AND THE ANALYST COMMUNITY. SHE WILL REPORT TO WENDY ARLIN, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER."}